WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
Coco, actually I have one more thing to apologize to you for.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,480
Jin Yi, what's wrong?

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,440
Sorry Coco

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:07,520
In fact, this afternoon I was unwilling to let you ignore me anymore, so before seeing you

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,240
I said some bad things about you to Lu Xing

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,240
maliciously speculated on you

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,120
But I didn't expect you to forgive me

8
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,520
Then it turns out that my guess about you was wrong. I'm sorry.

9
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,960
what did you say to me

10
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,920
I said your mother has been dealing with various men all year round to raise you.

11
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,280
So you may be deaf

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,320
learned something

13
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,480
Because I really can’t figure it out

14
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,440
Why did you save Lu Lin but didn’t tell me?

15
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,520
So I guess

16
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,880
Was it after you rescued Lu Lin?

17
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,840
I no longer like Jiang Mu and want to get close to him

18
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,040
I'm afraid I'm not beautiful

19
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,720
That’s why I deliberately allowed Jiang Muye and I to have public opinions flare up in the school.

20
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,040
That way you can be reasonable

21
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,720
Get rid of Jiang Mu and me too

22
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:38,200
Then you can approach Lu Ling without any distractions.

23
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,400
Is this boyfriend still Jiang Muye?

24
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,200
Now he has become Mr. Lu’s savior again

25
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:49,210
Not ordinary people can do it

26
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:51,340
Don't be angry

27
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,060
I'm just too sad
